{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-29 03:10:26 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: read_file_search_audit] Created research report: RESEARCH_SESSION_STATE_PERSISTENCE_20260128.md | action=create; agent_id=Scribe; agent_name=Scribe; confidence=1; doc=research_report; doc_name=RESEARCH_SESSION_STATE_PERSISTENCE_20260128; doc_type=research; document_type=research_report; file_path=/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_search_audit/research/RESEARCH_SESSION_STATE_PERSISTENCE_20260128.md; file_size=2050; files_investigated=[\"shared/execution_context.py\", \"server.py\", \"storage/sqlite.py\", \"tools/append_entry.py\", \"tools/read_file.py\", \"tools/agent_project_utils.py\"]; investigation_scope=[\"ExecutionContext lifecycle\", \"RouterContextManager persistence\", \"agent_sessions table\", \"module-level state patterns\", \"session boundaries\"]; project_name=read_file_search_audit; project_root=/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp; research_goal=Find how session state persists across MCP tool calls to enable read-before-edit enforcement; researcher=Scribe; section=; timestamp=2026-01-29 03:10:26 UTC; title=Research Session State Persistence 20260128; priority=medium; log_type=doc_updates; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_search_audit/DOC_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-29T03:10:26.909718+00:00_43d4c5bd", "timestamp": "2026-01-29T03:10:26.909786+00:00"}
