{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-29 05:32:43 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: read_file_search_audit] Created bug report: report.md | action=create; affected_paths=[]; agent_id=Scribe; agent_name=Scribe; body=# BUG-2026-01-29-0001: Stale projects/Scribe path references creating phantom directory  **Status:** Open **Reported:** 2026-01-29 **Reporter:** Orchestrator  ## Symptoms A directory at /home/austin/projects/Scribe/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.venv is being created. Old pip install logs and test artifacts reference projects/Scribe/MCP_SPINE instead of the correct projects/MCP_SPINE. Found in: =1.20.0 (pip log), scribe_mcp_fullcode.txt, multiple tmp_tests/ journal files, and tmp_tests/ architecture guides. No live Python code references this path but stale files may trigger directory creation.  ## Affected Paths _None specified_  ## Investigation _Add investigation notes here_  ## Root Cause _To be determined_  ## Fix _To be determined_  ## Verification - [ ] Root cause identified - [ ] Fix implemented - [ ] Tests added/updated - [ ] Fix verified ; case_id=BUG-2026-01-29-0001; category=infrastructure; doc=bug_report; doc_type=bug; document_type=bug_report; file_path=/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/docs/bugs/infrastructure/2026-01-29_BUG-2026-01-29-0001/report.md; file_size=1969; project_name=read_file_search_audit; project_root=/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp; reported_at=2026-01-29 05:32:43 UTC; section=; slug=BUG-2026-01-29-0001; symptoms=A directory at /home/austin/projects/Scribe/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.venv is being created. Old pip install logs and test artifacts reference projects/Scribe/MCP_SPINE instead of the correct projects/MCP_SPINE. Found in: =1.20.0 (pip log), scribe_mcp_fullcode.txt, multiple tmp_tests/ journal files, and tmp_tests/ architecture guides. No live Python code references this path but stale files may trigger directory creation.; timestamp=2026-01-29 05:32:43 UTC; title=Stale projects/Scribe path references creating phantom directory; priority=medium; log_type=doc_updates; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_search_audit/DOC_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-29T05:32:43.717036+00:00_51c835cb", "timestamp": "2026-01-29T05:32:43.717137+00:00"}
